   "subject": "Error in JAGS with single-visit sites and negative binomial",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">I am trying to fit a N-mixture model with\r\na negative binomial distribution for abundance in JAGS and get the following\r\nerror message which seems to consistently correspond to sites with a single\r\nvisit (number of visits across &gt;1,000 sites varies from 1-75, usually 2-12\r\nvisits):<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:10.6pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#c5060b\">Error in update.jags(object,\r\nn.iter, ...) : Error in node N[105]<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:10.6pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#c5060b\">Failure to calculate log\r\ndensity</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">In this example, site #105 has a single\r\nvisit with &gt;0 individuals detected. When I remove these single-visit\r\nobservations the model fits, and I can fit a N-mixture model with a Poisson\r\ndistribution (the NB model will also fit in unmarked). I’m not sure if it is an\r\nissue with my JAGS code, priors, starting values, or all three but I would\r\ngreatly appreciate any tips folks might have. I have tried varying my priors\r\nand starting values with no success. I have my R code (using jagsUI) below and\r\nam happy to send along my simulated data set.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Many thanks,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Javan <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">sink(&quot;Sim_Data _NegBinom.txt&quot;)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">cat(&quot;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">   \r\nmodel {<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">   \r\n# Priors<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">   \r\nlambda0 ~ dunif(-50,50)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">   \r\nbeta_SQR ~ dunif(-50,50)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">   \r\np0 ~ dunif(-50, 50)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">   \r\nbeta_HOURS ~ dunif(-50, 50)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">   \r\n# r ~ dunif(0.00001, 50)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">   \r\nr ~ dgamma(0.01,0.01) # Size param for Neg. Binom.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">    <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">    <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">   \r\n# Likelihood<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">   \r\nfor (i in 1:M) {<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">     \r\nN[i] ~ dnegbin(Q[i], r) <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">     \r\nQ[i] &lt;- r / (r + lambda[i]) <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">     \r\nlambda[i] &lt;- exp(mu[i])<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">     \r\nmu[i] &lt;- lambda0+beta_SQR*SQR[i]<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">    <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">     \r\nfor (j in 1:obs_units[i]) {<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">       \r\nCH[i,j] ~ dbin(p[i,j], N[i]) <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">       \r\np[i,j] &lt;- exp(lp[i,j])/(1+exp(lp[i,j]))<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">       \r\nlp[i,j] &lt;- p0+beta_HOURS*HOURS[i,j]<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">     \r\n}<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">   \r\n}<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> \r\n}&quot;,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">   \r\nfill = TRUE)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">sink()<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"># Initial values<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Nst &lt;- apply(deer.data$CH, 1,\r\nmax,na.rm=T)+3 <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">NB_inits &lt;- function() list(N = Nst,\r\nlambda0 = rnorm(1), beta_SQR = rnorm(1), <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">                            p0 = rnorm(1),<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">                            beta_HOURS =\r\nrnorm(1),<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">                            r = runif(1,0,1))<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p></div>"
    ]
   ]
